%% Lab 07: the five steps of one tool call, and where the rep's identity enters.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab07_tool_call_path.mmd -o lab07_tool_call_path.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as your app
    participant Agent as agent loop
    participant Model as model (OpenAI)
    participant API as Ops API

    App->>Agent: rep's message, context=RepContext(rep_id, rep_name)
    Agent->>Model: 1 messages + every tool schema
    Model-->>Agent: 2 tool call: name + JSON arguments
    Note over App,Agent: 3 check the arguments against the schema<br/>a bad one becomes an error message, no HTTP call
    Agent->>API: 3 tool body: one HTTP call, 5 s timeout,<br/>rep id from runtime.context
    API-->>Agent: 200 with JSON, or 404 / 422 with a detail
    Agent->>Model: 4 tool message with the call id, as text
    Model-->>Agent: 5 reply, or another tool call
    Agent-->>App: reply to the rep
    Note over Model,API: the model sees messages and schemas,<br/>not your code, the API or the context
